---
description: Project rules for anoted
alwaysApply: true
---

This is a Go cross-platform TUI app using Bubble Tea v2.

Architecture:
- TUI must not contain OS-specific logic.
- Platform-specific code must live behind interfaces.
- Use build tags for Linux and Windows.
- WSL2 must use a native Windows helper for real Windows audio capture.
- Audio recording must be explicit and visible to the user.
- Auto-record is disabled by default.
- No cloud upload.
- No hidden recording.
- No bypassing OS/browser privacy restrictions.

Coding style:
- Small interfaces.
- Clear errors with context.
- Testable packages.
- No unnecessary globals.
- Prefer standard library unless a dependency clearly improves the project.